  "content": "\n\n<h1>Holo 伤害指示器</h1>\n<p>一款<strong>客户端</strong>模组，通过可自定义的指示器实现伤害可视化，显示由伤害和治疗引起的生命值变化。</p>\n<p>要打开模组的配置界面，请使用命令<code>/damageindicator</code>，或通过 Fabric 的 Mod Menu 或内置的 (neo)Forge 配置菜单进入。</p>\n<h3>功能特性</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多种动画预设</strong></li>\n<li><strong>完全可自定义的文本格式</strong></li>\n<li><strong>支持文本颜色代码</strong></li>\n<li><strong>过滤伤害来源</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>如果您喜欢这个模组，可能也会对我 holo 系列的其他模组感兴趣：</em></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Modrinth</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Curseforge</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fholo-health-indicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Holo 生命指示器</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/holo-health-indicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Holo 生命指示器</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fholo-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Holo 物品</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/holo-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Holo 物品</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ray22777/BetterDamageIndicator/refs/heads/master/ezgif-6ffba28fe72ce215.webp\" alt=\"展示\"></p>\n<h3>配置</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ray22777/holographic_health_indicators/blob/master/configshowcase.png?raw=true\" alt=\"配置展示\"></p>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<h3>Fabric 依赖项</h3>\n<p>Mod Menu 为可选。其余均为必需。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Modrinth</th>\n<th>Curseforge</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HologramAPI</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HologramAPI</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>(Neo)Forge 依赖项</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Modrinth</th>\n<th>Curseforge</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HologramAPI</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">HologramAPI</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
